WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
In Makkah, a boy named Muhammad was born.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.648
His nurse Halima carried the tiny baby to the desert, where he grew up.

3
00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:11.888
Angels purified his heart, making it as pure as snow.

4
00:00:12.288 --> 00:00:17.016
As a boy, he tended sheep on the hillsides, watching the beautiful sunset.

5
00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:22.096
He was honest and trustworthy. People called him the Honest, the Trustworthy.

6
00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:27.128
As a young man, he led caravans across the desert, trading in faraway lands.

7
00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:30.000
Allah was preparing a great mission for him.
